--[[
	HierarchyScanner
	Place this Script in ServerScriptService and run the game/server.

	Purpose:
	- Audits the live Roblox hierarchy for instances required by this experience's scripts.
	- Reports valid instances, missing instances, wrong class types, full issue paths,
	  and the system/script that requires each instance.
	- Does NOT create, rename, move, or repair anything.

	Reviewed systems include player data saving/loading, tycoon plots, pads, vehicles,
	shops, gifts, rewards, leaderboards, teleporting, ranks, rebirths, remotes,
	remote functions, bindables, value objects, modules, and DataStore-adjacent APIs.
]]

